WEBVTT

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.998
wana muunganiko mmoja 
na kusudi moja,

00:03:31.022 --> 00:03:33.173
makubaliano ya kutokomeza ukatili
dhili ya watoto,

00:03:33.197 --> 00:03:35.911
na wanachukua hatua kujaribu
kufanya nchi zao kuingia

00:03:35.935 --> 00:03:40.026
kwenye njia ya kutokomeza kabisa
ukatili dhidi ya watoto ifikapo 2030.

00:03:40.612 --> 00:03:44.596
Na nchi nyingine nyingi,
majiji na majimbo yanaungana nao,

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:45.887
duniani kote.

00:03:46.739 --> 00:03:49.570
Lakini inamaanisha nini haswa,
inamaanisha nini kwa vitendo?

00:03:49.594 --> 00:03:51.839
Wanapofanya makubaliano hayo,
wanafanya nini?

00:03:51.863 --> 00:03:54.537
Inamaanisha makubaliano ya hali ya juu
kisiasa na kiuongozi.

00:03:54.561 --> 00:03:57.095
Kuweka na kutekeleza sheria.

00:03:57.921 --> 00:04:00.358
Na kuzindua mikakati,
kubadilisha sera,